	// Remove spaces? e.g., "2n + 1" (with spaces around +)? Spec allows spaces? e.g., ":nth-child(2n + 1)" with spaces? Unlikely in tests (they use "2n+1" without spaces). Handle spaces by removing all spaces? Actually "2n + 1" (with spaces) should be same as "2n+1". Remove spaces.
